{"temp_id":"CAND-06-009","topic":"行牌操作","category":"gameplay","title":"杠后补牌","requirement":"杠操作后从牌墙正序（或按配置倒序）补1张牌加入手牌","wiki_sources":["wiki/concepts/刮风下雨.md","wiki/concepts/行牌操作.md"],"raw_source_hints":["raw/mahjong/03-打牌操作.md","raw/mahjong/01-基础规则.md"]}
